{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "Imposta ApplyAfterRR a false; così anche danielblnc gira prima di Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction, se torni a usarlo." },
